bundle carries that file and the two licence texts named below beside this one.


Material Symbols Rounded
  crates/satz-studio/assets/fonts/MaterialSymbolsRounded.woff2

  The variable icon font the window draws its glyphs from, from the Material
  Symbols icon set. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its licence
  text is crates/satz-studio/assets/fonts/LICENSE-MaterialSymbols.


The tree-sitter grammar for Satz
  vendor/satz-tree-sitter/src/parser.c, grammar.json, node-types.json

  The generated parser the document layer reads with, copied from the grammar
  repository <https://github.com/tjirsch/satz-tree-sitter> at the commit named in
  vendor/satz-tree-sitter/COMMIT. That repository is separate from this one and
  keeps its own terms: the MIT Licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas Jirsch, whose
  text is vendor/satz-tree-sitter/LICENSE-satz-tree-sitter.


The tree-sitter runtime headers
  vendor/satz-tree-sitter/src/tree_sitter/alloc.h, array.h, parser.h

  Emitted beside every generated parser by tree-sitter and compiled into the core
  crate with it. From the tree-sitter project
  (<https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter>), under the MIT Licence, whose
  text is the one THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md carries for the tree-sitter crate.


satz
